[l_english.a_large_faction_goal_desc]
By growing even larger our faction will be able to project its influence even further.

[l_english.a_large_faction_goal_name]
Invite More Countries to our Faction

[l_english.a_military_base_goal_desc]
The crusade against communism requires guns. In order to produce guns in large quantities we need a strong military industry.

[l_english.a_military_base_goal_name]
Expand Military Industry

[l_english.aggressive_defense_goal_desc]
We shall not yield one inch to the enemy. Our soldiers must be instilled with the understanding that the key is not to die for our country, but to make the enemy die for theirs.

[l_english.aggressive_defense_goal_name]
Inflict Damage on the Aggressors

[l_english.air_superiority_goal_desc]
Control of the air dictates success on land and at sea. We must have sufficient fighter aircraft to secure our aerial dominance.

[l_english.air_superiority_goal_name]
Maintain Air Superiority

[l_english.industrial_expansion_goal_desc]
The best way to create a strong faction is to have a strong industrial base. We need to ensure that we have the industrial strength needed to become an important power.

[l_english.industrial_expansion_goal_name]
Industrial Expansion

[l_english.industrial_research_goal_desc]
In order to become a dominant player, we need to ensure that we have the industrial know-how across the faction.

[l_english.industrial_research_goal_name]
Research $construction4$

[l_simp_chinese.a_large_faction_goal_desc]
通过进一步扩大规模，我们的阵营将能够投射更大的影响力。

[l_simp_chinese.a_large_faction_goal_name]
邀请更多国家加入我们的阵营

[l_simp_chinese.a_military_base_goal_desc]
对抗共产主义运动需要枪支。为了大量生产枪支，我们需要强大的军事工业。

[l_simp_chinese.a_military_base_goal_name]
扩建军事工业

[l_simp_chinese.aggressive_defense_goal_desc]
我们不会向敌对势力让出一寸土地。要让士兵们明白：战斗的意义不在于为祖国献身，而在于让侵略者为他们的国家付出生命的代价。

[l_simp_chinese.aggressive_defense_goal_name]
对侵略者造成损害

[l_simp_chinese.air_superiority_goal_desc]
制空权决定陆地与海洋的成败。我们必须拥有足够的战斗机飞行器以确保空中优势。

[l_simp_chinese.air_superiority_goal_name]
维持制空权

[l_simp_chinese.industrial_expansion_goal_desc]
创建强大阵营的最好方法是拥有强大的工业基础。我们必须确保具备成为列强所需的工业实力。

[l_simp_chinese.industrial_expansion_goal_name]
工业扩张

[l_simp_chinese.industrial_research_goal_desc]
为了成为主导力量，我们需要确保阵营内部掌握全面的工业技术。

[l_simp_chinese.industrial_research_goal_name]
研究$construction4$
